{"id":"n64537-2-8","stage":2,"title":"달려오다 · 奔过来","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64537-2-8-1","ko":"민준이가 생각보다 빨리 왔네?","zh":"敏俊来得比想象中快啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이가","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"민준이가","audio":"/audio/2d578794e58a65e57305.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"생각보다","meaning":"念头，想法","explanation":"생각：念头，想法；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"3","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빨리","meaning":"快，赶快","explanation":"빨리：快，赶快","readings":[{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57305","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔네?","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"念头，想法","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"想做某事的心理或关注；或指那样的事。","pronunciation":["생각"]},{"id":"a5443c04aa0fdc08","term":"빨리","zh":"快，赶快","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3","entryId":"57305","definition":"花费的时间不长地。","pronunciation":["빨리"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"到达想去的地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/608f08237eb44f73e1df.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64537-2-8-2","ko":"이모가 오셨다니까 한걸음에 달려왔더라고.","zh":"听说姨妈来了，他就一口气跑过来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이모가","meaning":"阿姨，姨妈","explanation":"이모：阿姨，姨妈；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이모","audio":"/audio/dfd6511ae5195e09a7c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71153","senseId":"1","lemma":"이모","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오셨다니까","meaning":"来，来到；表示引用。","explanation":"오다：来，来到；하다：表示引用。；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한걸음에","meaning":"一；步伐，迈步","explanation":"한：一；걸음：步伐，迈步；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"},{"term":"걸음","audio":"/audio/13a94741bade96d290a3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"25578","senseId":"1","lemma":"걸음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"달려왔더라고.","meaning":"奔过来，赶过来","explanation":"달려오다：奔过来，赶过来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더라고：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"달려오다","audio":"/audio/5eb7bd7933c68207325b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64537","senseId":"2","lemma":"달려오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dfd6511ae5195e09","term":"이모","zh":"阿姨，姨妈","audio":"/audio/dfd6511ae5195e09a7c7.mp3","entryId":"71153","definition":"用于指称或称呼母亲的姐姐或妹妹。","pronunciation":["이모"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"一个的。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"13a94741bade96d2","term":"걸음","zh":"步伐，迈步","audio":"/audio/13a94741bade96d290a3.mp3","entryId":"25578","definition":"迈开双腿、交替移动双脚的动作。","pronunciation":["거름"]},{"id":"5eb7bd7933c68207","term":"달려오다","zh":"奔过来，赶过来","audio":"/audio/5eb7bd7933c68207325b.mp3","entryId":"64537","definition":"急急忙忙地快速赶来。","pronunciation":["달려오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7c3ee6af135c60397356.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.792,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=64537","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":63,"sequenceScore":1.5173,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["听说姨妈来了，他就一口气跑过来了。","妈妈做的菜真的很好吃。","敏俊来得比想象中快啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说姨妈来了，他就一口气跑过来了。","敏俊来得比想象中快啊？","妈妈做的菜真的很好吃。"],"answer":0}]}
